    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a pointer-based vector container. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Stores pointers to elements in a contiguous array. Tracks the number of elements currently stored and the allocated capacity.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="warning"><para>Avoid modifying the internal fields directly </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
